                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "It was an honor to speak at the ERIC Policy Summit and share how we\u2019re working in Congress to protect employer-sponsored insurance, expand access to care, and lower health care costs for working families. Grateful for the opportunity to join so many leaders focused on solutions that put patients first.",
