                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Had a great visit to IUS for a Science of Reading discussion. We talked about their strong partnerships with Ivy Tech, Hanover College, and the University of Indianapolis, as well as their impressive medical lab science program. They\u2019re working hard to build pipelines and create pathways that meet community needs\u2014and are already implementing changes aligned with the Indiana Literacy Framework.",
