                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Grateful to meet with the Family Resource Centers on Capitol Hill today. As a former Family Case Manager and a mom of three, I know the impact Family Resource Centers have. They offer real help\u2014job training, mental health support, parenting tools\u2014to keep families strong and kids out of crisis.",
