                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Recently, I had the opportunity to visit Margaret Mary Health to tour their Oncology Center and get a firsthand look at their new hospital currently under construction. A key focus of the visit was their impressive investment in geothermal energy\u2014an innovative, long-term solution to help power the future of healthcare in the region.",
