                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "MYTH: The One Big Beautiful Bill will close rural hospitals.\n\u2028FACT: The bill invests $50 billion to strengthen rural health care\u2014sending at least $100 million a year to every state to keep hospitals open, support providers, and improve care in small towns.\n\nThis bill protects rural health\u2014not threatens it.",
