                "text": "2.8 million people have been double-dipping on government health care, costing Americans $14 billion.\n\nThanks to the One Big Beautiful Bill Act, CMS now has the tools to stop the federal government from paying twice for the same care\u2014saving billions and restoring integrity to the system.",
